  "description": "Test build of Garen's Demacian Justice as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Garen so his ult deals 150 + 120% AD + 30% of the target's missing health as true damage, and the AI casts it only when it kills a champion in range (the main pack's casts it at once, at 12% of max health); an ult the AI wanted on a champion it would not kill no longer sends him after that champion under a tower, into a crowd or while hurt; Judgment spins once more for every 25% bonus attack speed, as in League. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
